{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018ZC7TAfh2PCCtWL7q5qZnP","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'C1/C2 在 2 judges 范围内成立，claims 加 scope qualifier \"across the two\n2\t  judges tested\"。 C3 GEE gradient 定位为 empirical finding 非 generalizable insight。 Register\n3\t  降为 method boundary case study。Blindspot 定位为 \"measurement sensitivity gap  documented\n4\t  in controlled setting\"。第 3 judge 仅覆盖 formality 1 axis，提供方向确认但不够升级 scope。 Findings\n5\t  3.0–3.5 稳定落位。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: Multi-judge formality pairwise (partial — 1/2 judges completed)\n10\t  plan_id: exp-001\n11\t  description: 'Claude-3.5-Sonnet 完成 formality pairwise+Likert scoring（100 pairs ×\n12\t    2 directions）。 Gemini-2.0-Flash 因 API 额度耗尽仅完成 ~40% calls，数据不足以纳入正式分析。 最终仅新增 1\n13\t    个 judge 的 formality 完整数据。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    claude_bt_win_prob: 0.62\n18\t    claude_bt_ci:\n19\t    - 0.54\n20\t    - 0.7\n21\t    claude_bt_p: 0.005\n22\t    claude_likert_ate: 0.03\n23\t    claude_likert_p: 0.42\n24\t    claude_likert_tie_rate: 0.68\n25\t    claude_likert_cohens_d: 0.03\n26\t    claude_consistency_rate: 0.58\n27\t    claude_blindspot_confirmed: true\n28\t    claude_gee_formal_or: 2.8\n29\t    claude_gee_formal_p: 0.006\n30\t    claude_gee_originality_or: 2.1\n31\t    claude_gee_originality_p: 0.03\n32\t    gemini_status: incomplete (~80/200 pairwise calls, excluded from analysis)\n33\t    gemini_partial_formal_win_trend: ~64% on available data, consistent direction\n34\t    total_api_spend: $32 (Claude $22 + Gemini partial $10)\n35\t  result_rationale: 'Claude-3.5-Sonnet 作为 Anthropic proprietary model，style sensitivity\n36\t    预期介于 GPT-4o (63.0%) 和 Qwen3-32B (66.5%) 之间偏低端。原因：(1) Claude 系列以 \"helpful, harmless\"\n37\t    训练，对 style  的 systematic preference 可能弱于 Qwen 的 RLHF-heavy 训练，(2) BT 0.62 处于 tier\n38\t    定义的 [0.58, 0.78] 区间下端，反映 \"方向确认但非最强信号\"。 Likert ATE NS (p=0.42) 延续 Blindspot pattern：tie\n39\t    rate ~68% 与其他 judge 一致（GPT-4o 62.5%, Qwen 72.7%），表明 Likert insensitivity 是 measurement\n40\t    structure 问题而非 judge-specific。 GEE decomposition 显示 formality-originality mixed\n41\t    pattern（与 GPT-4o/Qwen 同方向）， OR 值略高于 GPT-4o (2.21) 但低于 Qwen (4.20)——不同 judge 内部权重分配不同但\n42\t    pattern 一致。 Gemini 不完整是典型 median 档资源约束：~$30/judge × 2 judges 超出实际可用 API 预算弹性，\n43\t    第二个 judge 被 cut。论文只能脚注提及 \"partial directional evidence from a third judge\"。\n44\t\n45\t    '\n46\t  tables:\n47\t  - name: Cross-judge formality BT summary\n48\t    content: '| Judge        | BT P(formal) | 95% CI        | p       | Likert ATE\n49\t      | Likert p | Blindspot |\n50\t\n51\t      |-------------|-------------|---------------|---------|------------|----------|-----------|\n52\t\n53\t      | GPT-4o       | 0.630       | [0.558, 0.703] | <0.001  | ~0.08      | 0.332    |\n54\t      ✅        |\n55\t\n56\t      | Qwen3-32B    | 0.665       | [0.585, 0.739] | <0.0001 | 0.011      | 0.908    |\n57\t      ✅        |\n58\t\n59\t      | Claude-3.5   | 0.620       | [0.540, 0.700] | 0.005   | 0.03       | 0.42     |\n60\t      ✅        |\n61\t\n62\t      '\n63\t  figures_description:\n64\t  - Forest plot 新增 Claude-3.5 formality 行，3 judges CI 全部排除 0.50，点估计 0.62–0.665 密集分布\n65\t  analysis: '第 3 judge 方向一致 → C1 scope 可从 \"two judges\" 小幅升级为 \"across three judges\n66\t    on formality\"， 但仅 1 axis 覆盖不构成 full cross-judge validation。Reviewer 大概率认可方向一致性但\n67\t    不会因此提高 novelty 评分。对 Findings 评分的边际贡献约 +0.1 分（从 3.0 到 3.1）。\n68\t\n69\t    '\n70\t- name: Multi-benchmark formality pairwise (not executed)\n71\t  plan_id: exp-002\n72\t  description: '需要为 AlpacaEval/MT-Bench source texts 重新生成 counterfactuals（GPU 4h +\n73\t    API）， 再在 3 judges 上 scoring（~$60-90）。exp-001 仅部分完成 + exp-020 消耗剩余预算后， 本实验无法启动。\n74\t\n75\t    '\n76\t  expected_results:\n77\t    status: not_executed\n78\t    blocking_reason: API budget exhausted ($32 on exp-001 + ~$20 on exp-020); new\n79\t      CF generation requires additional GPU + API\n80\t    cf_generation_started: false\n81\t    paper_mitigation: 'Limitations section: ''Results demonstrated on LLMBar; benchmark\n82\t      generalization is future work.'''\n83\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设之一是 \"multi-judge 扩展不足\"。Multi-benchmark 比 multi-judge\n84\t    更资源密集 （需要全新 CF generation pipeline 运行），在 exp-001 已消耗主要 API 预算的前提下不可能执行。 这是 Findings\n85\t    vs Main 的关键差异：Main 需要 benchmark generalization，Findings 接受 single-benchmark deep\n86\t    analysis。论文需明确 acknowledge 但不影响 3.0–3.5 评分。\n87\t\n88\t    '\n89\t  tables: []\n90\t  figures_description: []\n91\t  analysis: 'Benchmark generalization 缺失是 median 档 Findings 定位的必然结果，不是失误。 Reviewer\n92\t    会列为 limitation 但不会因此 reject Findings-track submission。\n93\t\n94\t    '\n95\t- name: Likert vs Pairwise sensitivity analysis (partial — 2 full + 1 partial judge)\n96\t  plan_id: exp-003\n97\t  description: '基于 exp-001/exp-020 数据，整合 3 judges × formality + 2 judges × (verbosity,\n98\t    register)  的 Likert vs pairwise sensitivity 系统比较。7 个 available cells 的统一 sensitivity\n99\t    分析。\n100\t\n101\t    '\n102\t  expected_results:\n103\t    formality_blindspot_confirmed: 3/3 judges (GPT-4o, Qwen3-32B, Claude-3.5)\n104\t    verbosity_blindspot_confirmed: 2/2 judges (GPT-4o, Qwen3-32B)\n105\t    register_blindspot_confirmed: 1/2 (Qwen GEE sig → Blindspot; GPT-4o pairwise NS\n106\t      → unclassifiable)\n107\t    overall_blindspot_rate: 0.86\n108\t    avg_likert_tie_rate_across_cells: 0.66\n109\t    likert_tie_rate_range:\n110\t    - 0.58\n111\t    - 0.73\n112\t    sensitivity_gap_min: Likert p=0.179 vs pairwise p<0.0001 (Qwen verbosity)\n113\t    sensitivity_gap_max: Likert p=0.908 vs pairwise p<0.0001 (Qwen formality)\n114\t    power_deficit_likert: Mean effective n after ties = 34.7 (out of 100), vs pairwise\n115\t      effective n = 100\n116\t    meta_analytic_pairwise_mean_bt: 0.67\n117\t  result_rationale: 'Blindspot confirmation rate 0.86 (6/7 cells) 处于 tier 定义 [0.67,\n118\t    0.83] 的略上方， 但若仅计 2 primary judges 的 6 cells → 5/6 = 0.83 精确命中上限。 第 7 个 cell（Claude\n119\t    formality）提供额外 confirmation 但不改变 primary 计数。 Likert tie rate 稳定在 0.58–0.73 横跨所有\n120\t    judges 和 axes，这是 Blindspot 的 structural  根源：≥58% 的 Likert pairs 产生 ties，等效于将 n=100\n121\t    降至 n~35 的有效样本量， 解释了为何 moderate effect (BT 63–77%) 在 Likert 上 undetectable。 这个\n122\t    \"effective sample size\" 论证比单纯比较 p-values 更有力，因为它提供了 mechanistic explanation。\n123\t\n124\t    '\n125\t  tables:\n126\t  - name: Complete Likert vs Pairwise detection matrix\n127\t    content: '| Judge       | Axis       | BT P(win) | BT p     | Likert ATE | Likert\n128\t      p | Tie Rate | Blindspot |\n129\t\n130\t      |------------|-----------|-----------|----------|------------|----------|----------|-----------|\n131\t\n132\t      | GPT-4o      | Formality  | 0.630     | <0.001   | ~0.08      | 0.332    |\n133\t      0.625    | ✅        |\n134\t\n135\t      | GPT-4o      | Verbosity  | ~0.780    | <10⁻⁶   | -0.12      | 0.22     | 0.61     |\n136\t      ✅        |\n137\t\n138\t      | GPT-4o      | Register   | 0.580     | 0.085    | 0.05       | 0.55     |\n139\t      0.65     | ⬜        |\n140\t\n141\t      | Qwen3-32B   | Formality  | 0.665     | <0.0001  | 0.011      | 0.908    |\n142\t      0.727    | ✅        |\n143\t\n144\t      | Qwen3-32B   | Verbosity  | 0.773     | <0.0001  | -0.151     | 0.179    |\n145\t      0.581    | ✅        |\n146\t\n147\t      | Qwen3-32B   | Register   | GEE 1.91  | 0.046    | 0.074      | 0.505    |\n148\t      0.638    | ✅*       |\n149\t\n150\t      | Claude-3.5  | Formality  | 0.620     | 0.005    | 0.03       | 0.42     |\n151\t      0.68     | ✅        |\n152\t\n153\t      '\n154\t  figures_description:\n155\t  - 'Paired dot plot: 每个 cell 一组，左点 Likert p 右点 pairwise p，连线。6/7 连线从右上(NS)到左下(sig)，视觉冲击力强'\n156\t  analysis: 'C2 的最强版本表述：\"Across 7 judge×axis cells with available data, Likert scoring\n157\t    failed  to reach significance in all 7 cases (p range: 0.179–0.908), while pairwise\n158\t    comparison  detected significant style bias in 6/7 cells (p range: <10⁻⁶ to 0.005;\n159\t    register GPT-4o  marginal at p=0.085).\" 配合 tie rate mechanistic explanation →\n160\t    Findings 级 solid contribution。\n161\t\n162\t    '\n163\t- name: Pairwise RATE control (GPT-4o × LLMBar only)\n164\t  plan_id: exp-005\n165\t  description: 'GPT-4o 对 100 formality pairs 执行 RATE-style double-rewrite control：\n166\t    将每个 original text 做 identity double-rewrite (same style)，然后 pairwise compare  original\n167\t    vs double-rewrite。量化 judge 对 original text 的 inherent preference baseline。 仅在\n168\t    GPT-4o × LLMBar 上执行，未扩展到其他 judge × benchmark。\n169\t\n170\t    '\n171\t  expected_results:\n172\t    original_pairwise_win_rate: 0.57\n173\t    original_wilson_ci:\n174\t    - 0.47\n175\t    - 0.67\n176\t    original_sign_test_p: 0.16\n177\t    original_bt_prob: 0.555\n178\t    original_bt_ci:\n179\t    - 0.48\n180\t    - 0.63\n181\t    original_bt_p: 0.12\n182\t    original_likert_ate: 0.06\n183\t    original_likert_p: 0.45\n184\t    style_effect_vs_original: formal OR=2.21 p=0.010 >> original OR=1.82 p=0.052\n185\t    extended_to_other_judges: false\n186\t  result_rationale: 'exp-014 GEE 已独立估计 original preference OR=1.82 p=0.052（marginal）。直接\n187\t    RATE control  测量同一 confound 的 raw magnitude：~57% 偏好 original，不显著。 这个结果与 exp-014\n188\t    一致而非矛盾——original preference 存在但不足以解释 formal style effect。 关键论证链：(1) RATE control\n189\t    ~57% NS → original preference alone 不显著， (2) GEE 同时建模两个效应 → formal OR=2.21 显著\n190\t    after controlling original OR=1.82， (3) direction subset 进一步确认：formal→casual 78.8%\n191\t    但 casual→formal 54.5% →  originality confound 集中在 casual→formal direction，而 formal→casual\n192\t    几乎是 pure style。 未扩展到其他 judge 是 median 档资源约束——论文用 GPT-4o 数据论证 confound 量级足够， Qwen3-32B\n193\t    的 GEE 已提供跨模型 decomposition evidence。\n194\t\n195\t    '\n196\t  tables:\n197\t  - name: RATE control vs style effect decomposition\n198\t    content: '| Effect Source         | Measure      | Estimate | 95% CI      | p     |\n199\t      Significant |\n200\t\n201\t      |----------------------|-------------|----------|-------------|-------|-------------|\n202\t\n203\t      | Formal style (BT)    | BT win prob  | 0.630    | [0.558, 0.703] | <0.001 |\n204\t      ✅ |\n205\t\n206\t      | Original pref (RATE) | BT win prob  | 0.555    | [0.480, 0.630] | 0.12   |\n207\t      ❌ |\n208\t\n209\t      | Formal style (GEE)   | OR           | 2.21     | [1.21, 4.04]   | 0.010  |\n210\t      ✅ |\n211\t\n212\t      | Original pref (GEE)  | OR           | 1.82     | [0.99, 3.32]   | 0.052  |\n213\t      ❌ (marginal) |\n214\t\n215\t      '\n216\t  figures_description: []\n217\t  analysis: 'RATE control 提供直觉上简洁的论证：same sign test，original preference NS，style effect\n218\t    sig →  不可归因于 original preference。与 GEE decomposition 互为补充。 Reviewer 可能追问 \"what\n219\t    if original preference varies by judge?\"——这是 not extending 的风险， 但 Findings 标准下\n220\t    GPT-4o single-judge control + Qwen GEE 跨模型 decomposition 足够。\n221\t\n222\t    '\n223\t- name: Scaled replication n=300-500 (not executed)\n224\t  plan_id: exp-006\n225\t  description: '将 formality 实验从 n=100 扩展到 n=300-500 的 large-scale replication 未执行。\n226\t    前置依赖 exp-001/002 未充分完成，且预算优先分配给 exp-020 完成证据矩阵。\n227\t\n228\t    '\n229\t  expected_results:\n230\t    status: not_executed\n231\t    blocking_reason: Budget prioritized for 2×3 matrix completion (exp-020) and 3rd\n232\t      judge (exp-001)\n233\t    adequacy_argument: Current n=100 → BT CI width ~15pp, all primary cells exclude\n234\t      0.50\n235\t    power_curve_argument: BT at n=100 has >95% power for effects ≥0.63; scaling adds\n236\t      precision not detection\n237\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档的 resource allocation 逻辑：breadth (更多 cells/judges) 优于\n238\t    depth (单 cell 更大 n)。 当前 n=100 的 BT 对所有 primary cells 已有足够 power： - formality GPT-4o\n239\t    BT 63% CI [55.8, 70.3] → CI width 14.5pp, excludes 50% - Qwen verbosity BT 77.3%\n240\t    CI [70.3, 84.3] → CI width 14pp, excludes 50% n=300 会将 CI 收窄到 ~8pp，提供更精确的 point\n241\t    estimate 但不改变 any conclusion。 这对 Findings 评审者的 marginal value 远低于完成 2×3 矩阵（exp-020）或新增第\n242\t    3 judge（exp-001）。 论文中 power curve figure 已论证 n=100 的 adequacy——这个 figure 的存在本身就是对  \"why\n243\t    not larger n\" 的 preemptive answer。\n244\t\n245\t    '\n246\t  tables: []\n247\t  figures_description: []\n248\t  analysis: '不执行对评分无实质影响。如果 reviewer 提出 \"small n\" concern，power curve + existing CI  足以回应。真正的\n249\t    scaling need 是 multi-benchmark（exp-002）而非 single-benchmark larger n。\n250\t\n251\t    '\n252\t- name: Register axis GPT-4o scoring (via exp-020)\n253\t  plan_id: exp-008\n254\t  description: 'GPT-4o 对 94 个 NLI-verified register counterfactual pairs 执行 pairwise\n255\t    + Likert scoring。 CF verification 已完成（94% NLI pass）。与 exp-020 合并执行以节省 API 调用开销。\n256\t    Qwen3-32B register scoring 已在 exp-019 完成。\n257\t\n258\t    '\n259\t  expected_results:\n260\t    gpt4o_register_bt_win_prob: 0.58\n261\t    gpt4o_register_bt_ci:\n262\t    - 0.5\n263\t    - 0.66\n264\t    gpt4o_register_bt_p: 0.085\n265\t    gpt4o_register_likert_ate: 0.05\n266\t    gpt4o_register_likert_p: 0.55\n267\t    gpt4o_register_likert_tie_rate: 0.65\n268\t    gpt4o_register_consistency_rate: 0.55\n269\t    gpt4o_register_gee_academic_or: 1.75\n270\t    gpt4o_register_gee_academic_p: 0.08\n271\t    gpt4o_register_gee_originality_or: 3.5\n272\t    gpt4o_register_gee_originality_p: 0.002\n273\t    cross_judge_pattern: Both GPT-4o and Qwen3-32B show originality-dominated register\n274\t      axis\n275\t  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o register pairwise 63.3% p=0.085 已在早期实验中观察到（sign test on\n276\t    consistent pairs）。 BT 模型纳入 position-inconsistent pairs 后 point estimate 会下降至 ~58%，CI\n277\t    可能包含 0.50。 这与 GPT-4o 整体偏低的 style sensitivity 一致（formality BT 63% 也是 3 judges 中最低）。\n278\t    GEE decomposition 预期复制 Qwen3-32B 的 originality-dominated pattern： academic style\n279\t    OR ~1.75 (NS at p~0.08) vs originality OR ~3.50 (sig at p=0.002)。 GPT-4o 的 originality\n280\t    OR (3.50) 低于 Qwen (5.72) 是因为 GPT-4o 对 content quality  差异的 sensitivity 也弱于 Qwen（与\n281\t    formality 的 cross-judge pattern 一致）。 Register 在 GPT-4o 上 style effect 不显著 → 这个\n282\t    cell 不构成经典 Blindspot  （pairwise 本身 NS，Likert NS 是 expected null）。 但 GEE 揭示 originality\n283\t    confound 掩盖了 marginal style effect → 支持 C3 gradient narrative。\n284\t\n285\t    '\n286\t  tables:\n287\t  - name: Register GEE cross-judge decomposition\n288\t    content: '| Judge       | Academic OR | p     | Originality OR | p       | Ratio\n289\t      Orig/Style | Classification       |\n290\t\n291\t      |------------|-----------|-------|---------------|---------|-----------------|---------------------|\n292\t\n293\t      | Qwen3-32B   | 1.91      | 0.046 | 5.72          | <0.0001 | 3.0×            |\n294\t      Originality-dominated |\n295\t\n296\t      | GPT-4o      | 1.75      | 0.08  | 3.50          | 0.002   | 2.0×            |\n297\t      Originality-dominated |\n298\t\n299\t      '\n300\t  figures_description:\n301\t  - 'Forest plot register row: 两个 judge BT CI 均触及或跨越 0.50 虚线，与 formality/verbosity\n302\t    的清晰分离形成视觉对比'\n303\t  analysis: 'Register 在两个 judge 上一致 originality-dominated → C3 GEE gradient 右端点稳定。\n304\t    论文定位：register 不是 \"failed detection\"，而是 \"method boundary illustration\"—— 当 axis\n305\t    改变的不只是 surface style 时，content change dominates and pairwise signal is diluted。\n306\t    这给 practitioner 的 actionable insight：对 register-like axes 需要更强的 content control  或不同的\n307\t    measurement strategy。\n308\t\n309\t    '\n310\t- name: Non-Qwen rewriter control (not executed)\n311\t  plan_id: exp-009\n312\t  description: '使用 Llama-3.1-70B 或 Mistral 作为替代 rewriter 的控制实验。P2 优先级， 需 8h GPU +\n313\t    API 预算，在 P0/P1 实验完成后资源不足。\n314\t\n315\t    '\n316\t  expected_results:\n317\t    status: not_executed\n318\t    blocking_reason: P2 priority; GPU budget (8h) and API budget consumed by P0/P1\n319\t      experiments\n320\t    indirect_evidence: 'Cross-judge consistency (GPT-4o proprietary ≠ Qwen3-32B open-source,\n321\t      same direction)  provides partial mitigation — if CFs had Qwen-specific artifacts,\n322\t      different-family judges  would respond differently.\n323\t\n324\t      '\n325\t    paper_mitigation: Limitations section acknowledges single-rewriter setup; NLI\n326\t      gate is model-agnostic\n327\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档的 P2 实验预期不执行。资源分配逻辑： (1) exp-001 ($32) + exp-020 (~$20)\n328\t    + exp-005 (~$15) 已消耗约 $67 API 预算 (2) GPU 时间分配给 Qwen3-32B local scoring (exp-017/018/019\n329\t    ~6h)  (3) 剩余 GPU/API 不足以支持 8h Llama-3.1-70B rewriting + verification 论文通过三层间接论证\n330\t    mitigate： (a) NLI verification 是 model-agnostic 质量门控（exp-013 precision 98.9%）\n331\t    (b) 两个不同架构/训练的 judge 对相同 CFs 反应一致 (c) Formality CFs 的 direction-aware analysis\n332\t    排除了 systematic rewriting direction bias Reviewer 可能列为 weakness 但不 deal-breaking\n333\t    for Findings。\n334\t\n335\t    '\n336\t  tables: []\n337\t  figures_description: []\n338\t  analysis: '如果 reviewer 强烈要求，可在 camera-ready revision 阶段用 Llama-3.1 做 quick pilot\n339\t    （n=20 formality, ~2h GPU）。Median 档预期不需要——Findings 级别对 robustness check  的要求低于\n340\t    Main。\n341\t\n342\t    '\n343\t- name: GPT-4o verbosity + register scoring (completes 2×3 evidence matrix)\n344\t  plan_id: exp-020\n345\t  description: 'GPT-4o API 对 verbosity 100 pairs 和 register 94 pairs 执行完整 Likert +\n346\t    pairwise scoring。 关键缺失数据：GPT-4o verbosity Likert ATE（确认 6th Blindspot cell）。 Register\n347\t    数据在 exp-008 中合并报告。本条目聚焦 verbosity 新增数据。\n348\t\n349\t    '\n350\t  expected_results:\n351\t    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_win_prob: 0.78\n352\t    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_ci:\n353\t    - 0.7\n354\t    - 0.85\n355\t    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_p: <10⁻⁶\n356\t    gpt4o_verbosity_pairwise_raw_win_rate: 0.863\n357\t    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_ate: -0.12\n358\t    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_p: 0.22\n359\t    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_cohens_d: -0.11\n360\t    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_tie_rate: 0.61\n361\t    gpt4o_verbosity_blindspot_confirmed: true\n362\t    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_verbose_or: 10.5\n363\t    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_verbose_ci:\n364\t    - 4.2\n365\t    - 26.3\n366\t    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_verbose_p: <10⁻⁷\n367\t    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_originality_or: 0.55\n368\t    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_originality_ci:\n369\t    - 0.22\n370\t    - 1.38\n371\t    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_originality_p: 0.15\n372\t    gpt4o_register_bt_win_prob: 0.58\n373\t    gpt4o_register_bt_p: 0.085\n374\t    evidence_matrix_cells_with_data: 6\n375\t    blindspot_confirmed_cells: 5\n376\t    blindspot_note: Register GPT-4o pairwise NS → 5th cell unclassifiable as Blindspot\n377\t      but GEE reveals masked style effect\n378\t    total_api_cost: $19\n379\t    bt_win_prob_range_primary:\n380\t    - 0.58\n381\t    - 0.78\n382\t    likert_tie_rate_mean: 0.66\n383\t    gee_gradient_confirmed_cross_judge: true\n384\t  result_rationale: '**GPT-4o verbosity Likert ATE NS (p=0.22)** 是 median 档最关键的单一预测。推导逻辑：\n385\t\n386\t    (1) Qwen3-32B verbosity Likert ATE=-0.151 p=0.179，效应方向为 negative（verbose 得分反而略低），\n387\t    Cohen''s d=-0.146。GPT-4o 预期同模式：Likert 尺度上 verbose 和 concise 得分几乎无差异， 因为 Likert\n388\t    absolute scoring 对 \"哪个更好\" 的判断被 variance within score level 淹没。\n389\t\n390\t    (2) Tie rate ~61% 意味着有效样本量 n_eff ≈ 39。在 d=0.11 的效应下， 需要 n>500 才有 80% power 检测——当前\n391\t    n=100 (n_eff≈39) 严重 underpowered。 这与 power curve figure 的论证完全吻合。\n392\t\n393\t    (3) GPT-4o verbosity pairwise 86.3% 是全矩阵最强信号，但 Likert p=0.22 →  这是 Blindspot 的\n394\t    most dramatic demonstration：最大的 style bias 在 Likert 上完全不可见。 这个对比将成为 abstract/intro\n395\t    的 headline result。\n396\t\n397\t    (4) GEE decomposition 预期复制 Qwen3-32B 的 pure style pattern：verbose OR ~10.5  (略低于\n398\t    Qwen 13.10，因为 GPT-4o style sensitivity 系统性弱于 Qwen)， originality OR ~0.55 NS（方向一致——concise\n399\t    text 不因 content 被偏好，bias 完全来自 verbose style）。 Cross-judge GEE gradient 一致：verbosity\n400\t    pure style > formality mixed > register originality-dominated。\n401\t\n402\t    (5) API cost ~$19 可控（200 verbosity pairwise + 200 Likert + 188 register pairwise\n403\t    + 188 register Likert ≈ 776 API calls × ~$0.025/call）。\n404\t\n405\t    '\n406\t  tables:\n407\t  - name: Complete 2×3 Evidence Matrix (median tier final)\n408\t    content: '|            | GPT-4o BT [CI]              | GPT-4o Likert p | Qwen3-32B\n409\t      BT [CI]           | Qwen3-32B Likert p | Blindspot |\n410\t\n411\t      |-----------|---------------------------|-----------------|---------------------------|-------------------|-----------|\n412\t\n413\t      | Formality  | 63.0% [55.8, 70.3]***      | 0.332           | 66.5% [58.5, 73.9]****     |\n414\t      0.908             | 2/2 ✅    |\n415\t\n416\t      | Verbosity  | 78.0% [70.0, 85.0]****     | 0.22            | 77.3% [70.3, 84.3]****     |\n417\t      0.179             | 2/2 ✅    |\n418\t\n419\t      | Register   | 58.0% [50.0, 66.0] (NS)    | 0.55            | GEE OR=1.91 [1.01,\n420\t      3.58]*  | 0.505             | 1/2 ✅    |\n421\t\n422\t      '\n423\t  - name: Cross-judge GEE gradient (complete)\n424\t    content: '| Axis       | Judge     | Style OR | Style p  | Origin. OR | Origin.\n425\t      p | Classification       |\n426\t\n427\t      |-----------|----------|---------|----------|-----------|----------|---------------------|\n428\t\n429\t      | Verbosity  | Qwen3-32B | 13.10   | <10⁻⁹   | 0.49 (NS) | 0.096    | Pure style           |\n430\t\n431\t      | Verbosity  | GPT-4o    | 10.50   | <10⁻⁷   | 0.55 (NS) | 0.15     | Pure style           |\n432\t\n433\t      | Formality  | Qwen3-32B | 4.20    | 0.0002   | 4.70      | <0.0001  | Mixed                |\n434\t\n435\t      | Formality  | GPT-4o    | 2.21    | 0.010    | 1.82      | 0.052    | Mixed\n436\t      (marginal)     |\n437\t\n438\t      | Register   | Qwen3-32B | 1.91    | 0.046    | 5.72      | <0.0001  | Originality-dominated\n439\t      |\n440\t\n441\t      | Register   | GPT-4o    | 1.75    | 0.08     | 3.50      | 0.002    | Originality-dominated\n442\t      |\n443\t\n444\t      '\n445\t  figures_description:\n446\t  - 'Forest plot (Figure 3, final): 6 rows (2 judges × 3 axes), x-axis = BT win probability,\n447\t    dashed line at 0.50. Verbosity cells 最右 (0.77–0.78), formality 中间 (0.62–0.665),\n448\t    register 接近 0.50 (0.58). 视觉上清晰分离三档。\n449\t\n450\t    '\n451\t  - 'GEE gradient scatter: x = style OR (log scale), y = originality OR (log scale),\n452\t    6 points 按 axis 着色 (verbosity 蓝, formality 绿, register 红), 按 judge 标记 (圆/方)。 Verbosity\n453\t    右下角 (high style, low originality), register 左上角 (low style, high originality),\n454\t    formality 对角线上 (both moderate)。两个 judge 的同轴点紧密聚类 → cross-judge consistency。\n455\t\n456\t    '\n457\t  analysis: 'exp-020 完成后，median 档的证据结构完整： - C1: CSD pipeline detects style bias across\n458\t    2 judges × 3 axes (5/6 primary cells significant) - C2: Likert Blindspot confirmed\n459\t    in 5/6 cells; mechanism = tie-induced power deficit - C3: GEE gradient consistent\n460\t    across judges — verbosity pure → formality mixed → register originality-dominated\n461\t    - C4: Practitioner guidance grounded in complete 2×3 matrix\n462\t\n463\t    Forest plot + GEE gradient visualization 构成两个 key figures，配合 power curve (Figure\n464\t    1)  和 pipeline diagram (Figure 2) = 4 figures total（比 planned 3 多 1，但 GEE scatter  可以\n465\t    inline 在 results section 不占 figure slot）。\n466\t\n467\t    Expected review score 3.0–3.5 的支撑： - Evidence depth: 2×3 matrix complete, BT +\n468\t    GEE + ordinal regression, NLI validation - Writing quality: 3 figures (power curve\n469\t    + pipeline + forest plot), ≤8.5 pages, 22+ refs - Novelty cap: Likert Blindspot\n470\t    is domain transfer of known psychometric phenomenon → Findings - Risk: new reviewer\n471\t    scores novelty ≤2.5 → need writing + evidence to compensate to 3.0 floor'\n472\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c31a7728-a7db-4599-bbbd-5af253d1fc6a","uuid":"7b57035e-76e3-40e8-b690-0b3bc9775962","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:58:20.224Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T052420/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'C1/C2 在 2 judges 范围内成立，claims 加 scope qualifier \"across the two\n  judges tested\"。 C3 GEE gradient 定位为 empirical finding 非 generalizable insight。 Register\n  降为 method boundary case study。Blindspot 定位为 \"measurement sensitivity gap  documented\n  in controlled setting\"。第 3 judge 仅覆盖 formality 1 axis，提供方向确认但不够升级 scope。 Findings\n  3.0–3.5 稳定落位。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Multi-judge formality pairwise (partial — 1/2 judges completed)\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'Claude-3.5-Sonnet 完成 formality pairwise+Likert scoring（100 pairs ×\n    2 directions）。 Gemini-2.0-Flash 因 API 额度耗尽仅完成 ~40% calls，数据不足以纳入正式分析。 最终仅新增 1\n    个 judge 的 formality 完整数据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    claude_bt_win_prob: 0.62\n    claude_bt_ci:\n    - 0.54\n    - 0.7\n    claude_bt_p: 0.005\n    claude_likert_ate: 0.03\n    claude_likert_p: 0.42\n    claude_likert_tie_rate: 0.68\n    claude_likert_cohens_d: 0.03\n    claude_consistency_rate: 0.58\n    claude_blindspot_confirmed: true\n    claude_gee_formal_or: 2.8\n    claude_gee_formal_p: 0.006\n    claude_gee_originality_or: 2.1\n    claude_gee_originality_p: 0.03\n    gemini_status: incomplete (~80/200 pairwise calls, excluded from analysis)\n    gemini_partial_formal_win_trend: ~64% on available data, consistent direction\n    total_api_spend: $32 (Claude $22 + Gemini partial $10)\n  result_rationale: 'Claude-3.5-Sonnet 作为 Anthropic proprietary model，style sensitivity\n    预期介于 GPT-4o (63.0%) 和 Qwen3-32B (66.5%) 之间偏低端。原因：(1) Claude 系列以 \"helpful, harmless\"\n    训练，对 style  的 systematic preference 可能弱于 Qwen 的 RLHF-heavy 训练，(2) BT 0.62 处于 tier\n    定义的 [0.58, 0.78] 区间下端，反映 \"方向确认但非最强信号\"。 Likert ATE NS (p=0.42) 延续 Blindspot pattern：tie\n    rate ~68% 与其他 judge 一致（GPT-4o 62.5%, Qwen 72.7%），表明 Likert insensitivity 是 measurement\n    structure 问题而非 judge-specific。 GEE decomposition 显示 formality-originality mixed\n    pattern（与 GPT-4o/Qwen 同方向）， OR 值略高于 GPT-4o (2.21) 但低于 Qwen (4.20)——不同 judge 内部权重分配不同但\n    pattern 一致。 Gemini 不完整是典型 median 档资源约束：~$30/judge × 2 judges 超出实际可用 API 预算弹性，\n    第二个 judge 被 cut。论文只能脚注提及 \"partial directional evidence from a third judge\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-judge formality BT summary\n    content: '| Judge        | BT P(formal) | 95% CI        | p       | Likert ATE\n      | Likert p | Blindspot |\n\n      |-------------|-------------|---------------|---------|------------|----------|-----------|\n\n      | GPT-4o       | 0.630       | [0.558, 0.703] | <0.001  | ~0.08      | 0.332    |\n      ✅        |\n\n      | Qwen3-32B    | 0.665       | [0.585, 0.739] | <0.0001 | 0.011      | 0.908    |\n      ✅        |\n\n      | Claude-3.5   | 0.620       | [0.540, 0.700] | 0.005   | 0.03       | 0.42     |\n      ✅        |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Forest plot 新增 Claude-3.5 formality 行，3 judges CI 全部排除 0.50，点估计 0.62–0.665 密集分布\n  analysis: '第 3 judge 方向一致 → C1 scope 可从 \"two judges\" 小幅升级为 \"across three judges\n    on formality\"， 但仅 1 axis 覆盖不构成 full cross-judge validation。Reviewer 大概率认可方向一致性但\n    不会因此提高 novelty 评分。对 Findings 评分的边际贡献约 +0.1 分（从 3.0 到 3.1）。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-benchmark formality pairwise (not executed)\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '需要为 AlpacaEval/MT-Bench source texts 重新生成 counterfactuals（GPU 4h +\n    API）， 再在 3 judges 上 scoring（~$60-90）。exp-001 仅部分完成 + exp-020 消耗剩余预算后， 本实验无法启动。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    blocking_reason: API budget exhausted ($32 on exp-001 + ~$20 on exp-020); new\n      CF generation requires additional GPU + API\n    cf_generation_started: false\n    paper_mitigation: 'Limitations section: ''Results demonstrated on LLMBar; benchmark\n      generalization is future work.'''\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设之一是 \"multi-judge 扩展不足\"。Multi-benchmark 比 multi-judge\n    更资源密集 （需要全新 CF generation pipeline 运行），在 exp-001 已消耗主要 API 预算的前提下不可能执行。 这是 Findings\n    vs Main 的关键差异：Main 需要 benchmark generalization，Findings 接受 single-benchmark deep\n    analysis。论文需明确 acknowledge 但不影响 3.0–3.5 评分。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Benchmark generalization 缺失是 median 档 Findings 定位的必然结果，不是失误。 Reviewer\n    会列为 limitation 但不会因此 reject Findings-track submission。\n\n    '\n- name: Likert vs Pairwise sensitivity analysis (partial — 2 full + 1 partial judge)\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '基于 exp-001/exp-020 数据，整合 3 judges × formality + 2 judges × (verbosity,\n    register)  的 Likert vs pairwise sensitivity 系统比较。7 个 available cells 的统一 sensitivity\n    分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    formality_blindspot_confirmed: 3/3 judges (GPT-4o, Qwen3-32B, Claude-3.5)\n    verbosity_blindspot_confirmed: 2/2 judges (GPT-4o, Qwen3-32B)\n    register_blindspot_confirmed: 1/2 (Qwen GEE sig → Blindspot; GPT-4o pairwise NS\n      → unclassifiable)\n    overall_blindspot_rate: 0.86\n    avg_likert_tie_rate_across_cells: 0.66\n    likert_tie_rate_range:\n    - 0.58\n    - 0.73\n    sensitivity_gap_min: Likert p=0.179 vs pairwise p<0.0001 (Qwen verbosity)\n    sensitivity_gap_max: Likert p=0.908 vs pairwise p<0.0001 (Qwen formality)\n    power_deficit_likert: Mean effective n after ties = 34.7 (out of 100), vs pairwise\n      effective n = 100\n    meta_analytic_pairwise_mean_bt: 0.67\n  result_rationale: 'Blindspot confirmation rate 0.86 (6/7 cells) 处于 tier 定义 [0.67,\n    0.83] 的略上方， 但若仅计 2 primary judges 的 6 cells → 5/6 = 0.83 精确命中上限。 第 7 个 cell（Claude\n    formality）提供额外 confirmation 但不改变 primary 计数。 Likert tie rate 稳定在 0.58–0.73 横跨所有\n    judges 和 axes，这是 Blindspot 的 structural  根源：≥58% 的 Likert pairs 产生 ties，等效于将 n=100\n    降至 n~35 的有效样本量， 解释了为何 moderate effect (BT 63–77%) 在 Likert 上 undetectable。 这个\n    \"effective sample size\" 论证比单纯比较 p-values 更有力，因为它提供了 mechanistic explanation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Complete Likert vs Pairwise detection matrix\n    content: '| Judge       | Axis       | BT P(win) | BT p     | Likert ATE | Likert\n      p | Tie Rate | Blindspot |\n\n      |------------|-----------|-----------|----------|------------|----------|----------|-----------|\n\n      | GPT-4o      | Formality  | 0.630     | <0.001   | ~0.08      | 0.332    |\n      0.625    | ✅        |\n\n      | GPT-4o      | Verbosity  | ~0.780    | <10⁻⁶   | -0.12      | 0.22     | 0.61     |\n      ✅        |\n\n      | GPT-4o      | Register   | 0.580     | 0.085    | 0.05       | 0.55     |\n      0.65     | ⬜        |\n\n      | Qwen3-32B   | Formality  | 0.665     | <0.0001  | 0.011      | 0.908    |\n      0.727    | ✅        |\n\n      | Qwen3-32B   | Verbosity  | 0.773     | <0.0001  | -0.151     | 0.179    |\n      0.581    | ✅        |\n\n      | Qwen3-32B   | Register   | GEE 1.91  | 0.046    | 0.074      | 0.505    |\n      0.638    | ✅*       |\n\n      | Claude-3.5  | Formality  | 0.620     | 0.005    | 0.03       | 0.42     |\n      0.68     | ✅        |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired dot plot: 每个 cell 一组，左点 Likert p 右点 pairwise p，连线。6/7 连线从右上(NS)到左下(sig)，视觉冲击力强'\n  analysis: 'C2 的最强版本表述：\"Across 7 judge×axis cells with available data, Likert scoring\n    failed  to reach significance in all 7 cases (p range: 0.179–0.908), while pairwise\n    comparison  detected significant style bias in 6/7 cells (p range: <10⁻⁶ to 0.005;\n    register GPT-4o  marginal at p=0.085).\" 配合 tie rate mechanistic explanation →\n    Findings 级 solid contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: Pairwise RATE control (GPT-4o × LLMBar only)\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'GPT-4o 对 100 formality pairs 执行 RATE-style double-rewrite control：\n    将每个 original text 做 identity double-rewrite (same style)，然后 pairwise compare  original\n    vs double-rewrite。量化 judge 对 original text 的 inherent preference baseline。 仅在\n    GPT-4o × LLMBar 上执行，未扩展到其他 judge × benchmark。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    original_pairwise_win_rate: 0.57\n    original_wilson_ci:\n    - 0.47\n    - 0.67\n    original_sign_test_p: 0.16\n    original_bt_prob: 0.555\n    original_bt_ci:\n    - 0.48\n    - 0.63\n    original_bt_p: 0.12\n    original_likert_ate: 0.06\n    original_likert_p: 0.45\n    style_effect_vs_original: formal OR=2.21 p=0.010 >> original OR=1.82 p=0.052\n    extended_to_other_judges: false\n  result_rationale: 'exp-014 GEE 已独立估计 original preference OR=1.82 p=0.052（marginal）。直接\n    RATE control  测量同一 confound 的 raw magnitude：~57% 偏好 original，不显著。 这个结果与 exp-014\n    一致而非矛盾——original preference 存在但不足以解释 formal style effect。 关键论证链：(1) RATE control\n    ~57% NS → original preference alone 不显著， (2) GEE 同时建模两个效应 → formal OR=2.21 显著\n    after controlling original OR=1.82， (3) direction subset 进一步确认：formal→casual 78.8%\n    但 casual→formal 54.5% →  originality confound 集中在 casual→formal direction，而 formal→casual\n    几乎是 pure style。 未扩展到其他 judge 是 median 档资源约束——论文用 GPT-4o 数据论证 confound 量级足够， Qwen3-32B\n    的 GEE 已提供跨模型 decomposition evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: RATE control vs style effect decomposition\n    content: '| Effect Source         | Measure      | Estimate | 95% CI      | p     |\n      Significant |\n\n      |----------------------|-------------|----------|-------------|-------|-------------|\n\n      | Formal style (BT)    | BT win prob  | 0.630    | [0.558, 0.703] | <0.001 |\n      ✅ |\n\n      | Original pref (RATE) | BT win prob  | 0.555    | [0.480, 0.630] | 0.12   |\n      ❌ |\n\n      | Formal style (GEE)   | OR           | 2.21     | [1.21, 4.04]   | 0.010  |\n      ✅ |\n\n      | Original pref (GEE)  | OR           | 1.82     | [0.99, 3.32]   | 0.052  |\n      ❌ (marginal) |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'RATE control 提供直觉上简洁的论证：same sign test，original preference NS，style effect\n    sig →  不可归因于 original preference。与 GEE decomposition 互为补充。 Reviewer 可能追问 \"what\n    if original preference varies by judge?\"——这是 not extending 的风险， 但 Findings 标准下\n    GPT-4o single-judge control + Qwen GEE 跨模型 decomposition 足够。\n\n    '\n- name: Scaled replication n=300-500 (not executed)\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '将 formality 实验从 n=100 扩展到 n=300-500 的 large-scale replication 未执行。\n    前置依赖 exp-001/002 未充分完成，且预算优先分配给 exp-020 完成证据矩阵。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    blocking_reason: Budget prioritized for 2×3 matrix completion (exp-020) and 3rd\n      judge (exp-001)\n    adequacy_argument: Current n=100 → BT CI width ~15pp, all primary cells exclude\n      0.50\n    power_curve_argument: BT at n=100 has >95% power for effects ≥0.63; scaling adds\n      precision not detection\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档的 resource allocation 逻辑：breadth (更多 cells/judges) 优于\n    depth (单 cell 更大 n)。 当前 n=100 的 BT 对所有 primary cells 已有足够 power： - formality GPT-4o\n    BT 63% CI [55.8, 70.3] → CI width 14.5pp, excludes 50% - Qwen verbosity BT 77.3%\n    CI [70.3, 84.3] → CI width 14pp, excludes 50% n=300 会将 CI 收窄到 ~8pp，提供更精确的 point\n    estimate 但不改变 any conclusion。 这对 Findings 评审者的 marginal value 远低于完成 2×3 矩阵（exp-020）或新增第\n    3 judge（exp-001）。 论文中 power curve figure 已论证 n=100 的 adequacy——这个 figure 的存在本身就是对  \"why\n    not larger n\" 的 preemptive answer。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '不执行对评分无实质影响。如果 reviewer 提出 \"small n\" concern，power curve + existing CI  足以回应。真正的\n    scaling need 是 multi-benchmark（exp-002）而非 single-benchmark larger n。\n\n    '\n- name: Register axis GPT-4o scoring (via exp-020)\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'GPT-4o 对 94 个 NLI-verified register counterfactual pairs 执行 pairwise\n    + Likert scoring。 CF verification 已完成（94% NLI pass）。与 exp-020 合并执行以节省 API 调用开销。\n    Qwen3-32B register scoring 已在 exp-019 完成。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o_register_bt_win_prob: 0.58\n    gpt4o_register_bt_ci:\n    - 0.5\n    - 0.66\n    gpt4o_register_bt_p: 0.085\n    gpt4o_register_likert_ate: 0.05\n    gpt4o_register_likert_p: 0.55\n    gpt4o_register_likert_tie_rate: 0.65\n    gpt4o_register_consistency_rate: 0.55\n    gpt4o_register_gee_academic_or: 1.75\n    gpt4o_register_gee_academic_p: 0.08\n    gpt4o_register_gee_originality_or: 3.5\n    gpt4o_register_gee_originality_p: 0.002\n    cross_judge_pattern: Both GPT-4o and Qwen3-32B show originality-dominated register\n      axis\n  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o register pairwise 63.3% p=0.085 已在早期实验中观察到（sign test on\n    consistent pairs）。 BT 模型纳入 position-inconsistent pairs 后 point estimate 会下降至 ~58%，CI\n    可能包含 0.50。 这与 GPT-4o 整体偏低的 style sensitivity 一致（formality BT 63% 也是 3 judges 中最低）。\n    GEE decomposition 预期复制 Qwen3-32B 的 originality-dominated pattern： academic style\n    OR ~1.75 (NS at p~0.08) vs originality OR ~3.50 (sig at p=0.002)。 GPT-4o 的 originality\n    OR (3.50) 低于 Qwen (5.72) 是因为 GPT-4o 对 content quality  差异的 sensitivity 也弱于 Qwen（与\n    formality 的 cross-judge pattern 一致）。 Register 在 GPT-4o 上 style effect 不显著 → 这个\n    cell 不构成经典 Blindspot  （pairwise 本身 NS，Likert NS 是 expected null）。 但 GEE 揭示 originality\n    confound 掩盖了 marginal style effect → 支持 C3 gradient narrative。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Register GEE cross-judge decomposition\n    content: '| Judge       | Academic OR | p     | Originality OR | p       | Ratio\n      Orig/Style | Classification       |\n\n      |------------|-----------|-------|---------------|---------|-----------------|---------------------|\n\n      | Qwen3-32B   | 1.91      | 0.046 | 5.72          | <0.0001 | 3.0×            |\n      Originality-dominated |\n\n      | GPT-4o      | 1.75      | 0.08  | 3.50          | 0.002   | 2.0×            |\n      Originality-dominated |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot register row: 两个 judge BT CI 均触及或跨越 0.50 虚线，与 formality/verbosity\n    的清晰分离形成视觉对比'\n  analysis: 'Register 在两个 judge 上一致 originality-dominated → C3 GEE gradient 右端点稳定。\n    论文定位：register 不是 \"failed detection\"，而是 \"method boundary illustration\"—— 当 axis\n    改变的不只是 surface style 时，content change dominates and pairwise signal is diluted。\n    这给 practitioner 的 actionable insight：对 register-like axes 需要更强的 content control  或不同的\n    measurement strategy。\n\n    '\n- name: Non-Qwen rewriter control (not executed)\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: '使用 Llama-3.1-70B 或 Mistral 作为替代 rewriter 的控制实验。P2 优先级， 需 8h GPU +\n    API 预算，在 P0/P1 实验完成后资源不足。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    blocking_reason: P2 priority; GPU budget (8h) and API budget consumed by P0/P1\n      experiments\n    indirect_evidence: 'Cross-judge consistency (GPT-4o proprietary ≠ Qwen3-32B open-source,\n      same direction)  provides partial mitigation — if CFs had Qwen-specific artifacts,\n      different-family judges  would respond differently.\n\n      '\n    paper_mitigation: Limitations section acknowledges single-rewriter setup; NLI\n      gate is model-agnostic\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档的 P2 实验预期不执行。资源分配逻辑： (1) exp-001 ($32) + exp-020 (~$20)\n    + exp-005 (~$15) 已消耗约 $67 API 预算 (2) GPU 时间分配给 Qwen3-32B local scoring (exp-017/018/019\n    ~6h)  (3) 剩余 GPU/API 不足以支持 8h Llama-3.1-70B rewriting + verification 论文通过三层间接论证\n    mitigate： (a) NLI verification 是 model-agnostic 质量门控（exp-013 precision 98.9%）\n    (b) 两个不同架构/训练的 judge 对相同 CFs 反应一致 (c) Formality CFs 的 direction-aware analysis\n    排除了 systematic rewriting direction bias Reviewer 可能列为 weakness 但不 deal-breaking\n    for Findings。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '如果 reviewer 强烈要求，可在 camera-ready revision 阶段用 Llama-3.1 做 quick pilot\n    （n=20 formality, ~2h GPU）。Median 档预期不需要——Findings 级别对 robustness check  的要求低于\n    Main。\n\n    '\n- name: GPT-4o verbosity + register scoring (completes 2×3 evidence matrix)\n  plan_id: exp-020\n  description: 'GPT-4o API 对 verbosity 100 pairs 和 register 94 pairs 执行完整 Likert +\n    pairwise scoring。 关键缺失数据：GPT-4o verbosity Likert ATE（确认 6th Blindspot cell）。 Register\n    数据在 exp-008 中合并报告。本条目聚焦 verbosity 新增数据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_win_prob: 0.78\n    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_ci:\n    - 0.7\n    - 0.85\n    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_p: <10⁻⁶\n    gpt4o_verbosity_pairwise_raw_win_rate: 0.863\n    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_ate: -0.12\n    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_p: 0.22\n    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_cohens_d: -0.11\n    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_tie_rate: 0.61\n    gpt4o_verbosity_blindspot_confirmed: true\n    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_verbose_or: 10.5\n    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_verbose_ci:\n    - 4.2\n    - 26.3\n    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_verbose_p: <10⁻⁷\n    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_originality_or: 0.55\n    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_originality_ci:\n    - 0.22\n    - 1.38\n    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_originality_p: 0.15\n    gpt4o_register_bt_win_prob: 0.58\n    gpt4o_register_bt_p: 0.085\n    evidence_matrix_cells_with_data: 6\n    blindspot_confirmed_cells: 5\n    blindspot_note: Register GPT-4o pairwise NS → 5th cell unclassifiable as Blindspot\n      but GEE reveals masked style effect\n    total_api_cost: $19\n    bt_win_prob_range_primary:\n    - 0.58\n    - 0.78\n    likert_tie_rate_mean: 0.66\n    gee_gradient_confirmed_cross_judge: true\n  result_rationale: '**GPT-4o verbosity Likert ATE NS (p=0.22)** 是 median 档最关键的单一预测。推导逻辑：\n\n    (1) Qwen3-32B verbosity Likert ATE=-0.151 p=0.179，效应方向为 negative（verbose 得分反而略低），\n    Cohen''s d=-0.146。GPT-4o 预期同模式：Likert 尺度上 verbose 和 concise 得分几乎无差异， 因为 Likert\n    absolute scoring 对 \"哪个更好\" 的判断被 variance within score level 淹没。\n\n    (2) Tie rate ~61% 意味着有效样本量 n_eff ≈ 39。在 d=0.11 的效应下， 需要 n>500 才有 80% power 检测——当前\n    n=100 (n_eff≈39) 严重 underpowered。 这与 power curve figure 的论证完全吻合。\n\n    (3) GPT-4o verbosity pairwise 86.3% 是全矩阵最强信号，但 Likert p=0.22 →  这是 Blindspot 的\n    most dramatic demonstration：最大的 style bias 在 Likert 上完全不可见。 这个对比将成为 abstract/intro\n    的 headline result。\n\n    (4) GEE decomposition 预期复制 Qwen3-32B 的 pure style pattern：verbose OR ~10.5  (略低于\n    Qwen 13.10，因为 GPT-4o style sensitivity 系统性弱于 Qwen)， originality OR ~0.55 NS（方向一致——concise\n    text 不因 content 被偏好，bias 完全来自 verbose style）。 Cross-judge GEE gradient 一致：verbosity\n    pure style > formality mixed > register originality-dominated。\n\n    (5) API cost ~$19 可控（200 verbosity pairwise + 200 Likert + 188 register pairwise\n    + 188 register Likert ≈ 776 API calls × ~$0.025/call）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Complete 2×3 Evidence Matrix (median tier final)\n    content: '|            | GPT-4o BT [CI]              | GPT-4o Likert p | Qwen3-32B\n      BT [CI]           | Qwen3-32B Likert p | Blindspot |\n\n      |-----------|---------------------------|-----------------|---------------------------|-------------------|-----------|\n\n      | Formality  | 63.0% [55.8, 70.3]***      | 0.332           | 66.5% [58.5, 73.9]****     |\n      0.908             | 2/2 ✅    |\n\n      | Verbosity  | 78.0% [70.0, 85.0]****     | 0.22            | 77.3% [70.3, 84.3]****     |\n      0.179             | 2/2 ✅    |\n\n      | Register   | 58.0% [50.0, 66.0] (NS)    | 0.55            | GEE OR=1.91 [1.01,\n      3.58]*  | 0.505             | 1/2 ✅    |\n\n      '\n  - name: Cross-judge GEE gradient (complete)\n    content: '| Axis       | Judge     | Style OR | Style p  | Origin. OR | Origin.\n      p | Classification       |\n\n      |-----------|----------|---------|----------|-----------|----------|---------------------|\n\n      | Verbosity  | Qwen3-32B | 13.10   | <10⁻⁹   | 0.49 (NS) | 0.096    | Pure style           |\n\n      | Verbosity  | GPT-4o    | 10.50   | <10⁻⁷   | 0.55 (NS) | 0.15     | Pure style           |\n\n      | Formality  | Qwen3-32B | 4.20    | 0.0002   | 4.70      | <0.0001  | Mixed                |\n\n      | Formality  | GPT-4o    | 2.21    | 0.010    | 1.82      | 0.052    | Mixed\n      (marginal)     |\n\n      | Register   | Qwen3-32B | 1.91    | 0.046    | 5.72      | <0.0001  | Originality-dominated\n      |\n\n      | Register   | GPT-4o    | 1.75    | 0.08     | 3.50      | 0.002    | Originality-dominated\n      |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot (Figure 3, final): 6 rows (2 judges × 3 axes), x-axis = BT win probability,\n    dashed line at 0.50. Verbosity cells 最右 (0.77–0.78), formality 中间 (0.62–0.665),\n    register 接近 0.50 (0.58). 视觉上清晰分离三档。\n\n    '\n  - 'GEE gradient scatter: x = style OR (log scale), y = originality OR (log scale),\n    6 points 按 axis 着色 (verbosity 蓝, formality 绿, register 红), 按 judge 标记 (圆/方)。 Verbosity\n    右下角 (high style, low originality), register 左上角 (low style, high originality),\n    formality 对角线上 (both moderate)。两个 judge 的同轴点紧密聚类 → cross-judge consistency。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-020 完成后，median 档的证据结构完整： - C1: CSD pipeline detects style bias across\n    2 judges × 3 axes (5/6 primary cells significant) - C2: Likert Blindspot confirmed\n    in 5/6 cells; mechanism = tie-induced power deficit - C3: GEE gradient consistent\n    across judges — verbosity pure → formality mixed → register originality-dominated\n    - C4: Practitioner guidance grounded in complete 2×3 matrix\n\n    Forest plot + GEE gradient visualization 构成两个 key figures，配合 power curve (Figure\n    1)  和 pipeline diagram (Figure 2) = 4 figures total（比 planned 3 多 1，但 GEE scatter  可以\n    inline 在 results section 不占 figure slot）。\n\n    Expected review score 3.0–3.5 的支撑： - Evidence depth: 2×3 matrix complete, BT +\n    GEE + ordinal regression, NLI validation - Writing quality: 3 figures (power curve\n    + pipeline + forest plot), ≤8.5 pages, 22+ refs - Novelty cap: Likert Blindspot\n    is domain transfer of known psychometric phenomenon → Findings - Risk: new reviewer\n    scores novelty ≤2.5 → need writing + evidence to compensate to 3.0 floor'\n","numLines":472,"startLine":1,"totalLines":472}}}
