{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SxRLn7D6EpPUVRkBwXuePf","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# causal_style_decomp_judge — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-21 05:57 UTC | 更新原因: D038 Qwen3-32B register BT corrected to 55.3% p=0.076 NS, \\\\\\\"4+2\\\\\\\" framing adopted\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**The Likert Blindspot**: 标准 Likert scoring 系统性掩盖 LLM judge 的 style bias。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Review Response 完成 — 18/19 issues resolved，Dream reviewing 中，Paper Agent 整合 \\\\\\\"4+2\\\\\\\" framing**\\\\n\\\\n### 完整证据矩阵 (2 judges × 3 axes — \\\\\\\"4+2\\\\\\\" pattern)\\\\n| | GPT-4o BT / Likert | Qwen3-32B BT / Likert |\\\\n|---|---------------------|----------------------|\\\\n| **Formality** | 63.0% p<.001 / p=.332 ✅ | 66.5% p<.0001 / p=.908 ✅ |\\\\n| **Verbosity** | 76.0% p=.0001 / p=.403 ✅ | 77.3% p<.0001 / p=.179 ✅ |\\\\n| **Register** | 57.0% p=.04 / p=.785 ⚠️ | 55.3% p=.076 / p=.505 ❌ |\\\\n\\\\n**4 strong Blindspot** (formality + verbosity × 2 judges) + **2 weak register** (GPT-4o marginal, Qwen3-32B NS)\\\\n\\\\n**GEE Gradient** (跨 judge 完美复现):\\\\n- Verbosity: GPT-4o OR=10.97 / Qwen3-32B OR=13.10 (pure style, originality NS)\\\\n- Formality: 2.21 / 4.20 (mixed with originality)\\\\n- Register: 1.88 / 1.91 (originality-dominated, GEE style still significant after control)\\\\n\\\\n### Review Issues: 18/19 resolved\\\\n唯一未解决: R2-N1 novelty ceiling (结构性限制)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] GPT-4o Likert ATE + BT + GEE 统计分析 (D037)\\\\n- [x] Qwen3-32B register BT pair-level bootstrap 修正 (D038: 55.3% p=0.076 NS)\\\\n- [x] Forest plot 重新生成（一致 BT 方法论，16.4KB）\\\\n- [x] review_issues.yaml 18/19\\\\n- [x] Paper Agent: Table 1 + evidence integration\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: \\\\\\\"4+2\\\\\\\" claim strength framing patch (queued)\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: Response letter framework draft (processing)\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream reviewing 中 (dream_20260521T052420)\\\\n- [ ] Dream 结果分析 + 行动\\\\n- [ ] 提交 Round 2 审稿 (submit_paper_to_review)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nwestb-29275: 4× RTX PRO 6000 96GB — 全部空闲\\\\n\\\\n## API 状态\\\\n- OpenAI (GPT-4o): ✅ | Claude/Gemini: ❌ (proxy limitation)\\\\n- 扩展 judge 需要 API proxy 调查（Reviewer #26 建议，path to 4.0）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D038 | 2026-05-21 | Qwen3-32B register BT pair-level bootstrap: P=0.55 | exp-019 |\\\\n| D037 | 2026-05-21 | GPT-4o 完整统计分析完成：Verbosity BT 76.0% p=0.0001 + Like | exp-020 |\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-21 | GPT-4o verbosity 86.3% p<10⁻⁶ + register 63.3% p=0 | exp-020 |\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-21 | Qwen3-32B BT + GEE 完成：BT formality 66.5% p<0.0001, | qwen32b_formality, qwen32b_verbosity, qwen32b_register |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-21 | Qwen3-32B 确认 Blindspot 跨 2 judges × 2 axes。Verbosi | qwen32b_formality, qwen32b_verbosity, qwen32b_register |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-21 | Claim framing: 机制性 \\\\\\\"structural limitation\\\\\\\" 可说，量化 r | exp-015, exp-016 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-21 | 最终 canonical BT 数字：63.0% [55.8%, 70.3%] p<0.001（17 | exp-016 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-21 | 全文数字统一：BT 62% 为 primary headline，退役 69.1%，sign tes | exp-016, pairwise_32b |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-21 | Power curve 修正：tie rate + consistency filter + Hoe | exp-010, exp-016 |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-21 | Ordinal regression 无 RE 是反保守检验（加强 Blindspot 结论）+ 方 | exp-015, exp-016 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2905, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01En36V24Y5wN7AVuRMBbnW2","session_id":"c31a7728-a7db-4599-bbbd-5af253d1fc6a","uuid":"855139f9-947f-43dd-986c-89cb67e1e296","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:59:22.839Z"}
