{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LqSW2hJbY31fseL9QjV4EL","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — causal_style_decomp_judge\\\\n\\\\n## 服务器环境 (westb-29275)\\\\n- SSH: `causal_style_decomp_judge`（~/.ssh/config 别名，免密）\\\\n- GPU: 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB, torch=2.11.0+cu130\\\\n- 环境: aml-train 镜像, conda base (`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`)\\\\n- 数据盘: `/root/autodl-tmp/` 250GB\\\\n- **网络**: AutoDL 网络受限，每次 SSH 会话需 `source /etc/network_turbo`\\\\n- **CUDA JIT**: `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` 需包含 `/root/miniconda3/lib/python3.12/site-packages/nvidia/cu13/lib`\\\\n- **GPU 3 有驱动异常**（100% util/0 MiB），不可用，只用 GPU 0-2\\\\n- **HF 网络**: 必须设 `TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1 HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1` 避免 HF Hub 请求挂起\\\\n\\\\n## 模型路径\\\\n- NLI: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/nli-deberta-v3-large/`\\\\n- BERTScore: `microsoft/deberta-xlarge-mnli` 在 HF cache `/root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/`\\\\n- Qwen3-8B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-8B/`\\\\n- Qwen3-32B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-32B/` ✅ 完成（17 shards, 62GB）\\\\n\\\\n## API 配置\\\\n- **统一 proxy endpoint**: `http://47.94.22.126/v1`\\\\n- GPT-4o: key_id=`openai_api_key_direct` — ✅ 可用\\\\n- Claude Sonnet 4: key_id=`claude_api_key` — ❌ 代理不支持\\\\n- Gemini 2.0 Flash: key_id=`gemini_api_key` — ❌ 代理不支持\\\\n- **只有 OpenAI 可通过代理使用**，Claude/Gemini 需直接 API key\\\\n\\\\n## 数据\\\\n- MVP 数据: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/mvp_samples.jsonl` (100 条, seed=42)\\\\n- Pipeline 输出目录: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/`\\\\n- exp-005 RATE control: `data/rate_control_input.jsonl` (88 条, NLI≥0.90 过滤)\\\\n- Verified datasets: `verified_32b.jsonl`(100), `verified_verbosity.jsonl`(86 NLI-pass), `verified_register.jsonl`(94 NLI-pass), `verified_alpacaeval.jsonl`(86 NLI-pass), `verified_mtbench.jsonl`(73 NLI-pass)\\\\n\\\\n## RATE 方法 axis 可行性梯度（核心发现）\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | 改变了什么 | NLI 策略 | Pass rate | 结论 |\\\\n|------|-----------|----------|-----------|------|\\\\n| Formality | 表面 register | Bidirectional min(fwd,bwd) | 88% ✅ | 完全可行 |\\\\n| Verbosity | 信息量 | Direction-aware (D012/D013) | 86% ✅ | 需 NLI-only gate + direction-aware |\\\\n| Register | 话语情境 | NLI-only (D019) | 95% ✅ | NLI-only gate，与 formality 正交 (50%) |\\\\n| Tone | 认知承诺 | Bidirectional | 45% ❌ | 结构性不可行 |\\\\n\\\\n**D023 决策：所有 axis 统一使用 NLI-only gating**（threshold 0.90）。\\\\n\\\\n## NLI Gate 特性（exp-013 发现）\\\\n\\\\nNLI gate (DeBERTa-v3-large, threshold 0.90) 是 **precision-oriented conservative filter**：\\\\n- Precision 98.9%, Recall 91.6%, PABAK=0.82, AC1=0.89\\\\n- Kappa paradox（Feinstein & Cicchetti 1990）：base rate 88:12 → kappa=0.43 低估\\\\n\\\\n## 完整 2×3 矩阵（C1/C2/C3/C4 核心 evidence）\\\\n\\\\n### Blindspot 矩阵\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Axis | BT P(style) | BT p | Likert p | Tie Rate | Blindspot? |\\\\n|-------|------|-------------|------|----------|----------|------------|\\\\n| GPT-4o | Formality | 63.0% | <0.001 | 0.332 | 62.5% | ✅ |\\\\n| GPT-4o | **Verbosity** | **76.0%** | **0.0001** | **0.403** | 58.1% | **✅** |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Register | 57.0% | 0.04 | 0.785 | 64.9% | ✅ |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Formality | 66.5% | <0.0001 | 0.908 | 72.7% | ✅ |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | **Verbosity** | **77.3%** | **<0.0001** | **0.179** | 58.1% | **✅** |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Register | 59.3% | 0.220 | 0.505 | 63.8% | — |\\\\n\\\\n**5/6 cells Blindspot confirmed**。唯一例外：Qwen3-32B register pairwise p=0.22 不显著。\\\\n\\\\n### GEE Decomposition 完整 Gradient\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Axis | Style OR | Style p | Orig OR | Orig p | 解读 |\\\\n|-------|------|----------|---------|---------|--------|------|\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | **Verbosity** | **13.10** | 2.6e-09 | 0.49 | 0.096 ns | **纯 style bias** |\\\\n| GPT-4o | **Verbosity** | **10.97** | <0.0001 | 0.44 | 0.051 ns | **纯 style bias** |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Formality | 4.20 | 0.0002 | 4.70 | <0.0001 | Style ≈ Orig |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Formality | 2.21 | 0.010 | 1.82 | 0.052 | Style > Orig |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Register | 1.88 | 0.028 | 2.21 | 0.006 | Orig > Style |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Register | 1.91 | 0.046 | 5.72 | <0.0001 | Orig >> Style |\\\\n\\\\n### 跨模型一致性（论文核心 argument）\\\\n- **Verbosity**: 两模型 Style OR=10-13，Orig OR<1 ns → **纯 style bias 是 model-independent**\\\\n- **Register**: 两模型 Style OR≈1.9 → **几乎相同的边缘 style effect**\\\\n- **Formality**: Qwen3-32B 双效应更强但 pattern 一致\\\\n\\\\n### C3 Axis Gradient\\\\n- **Verbosity = 纯 style bias**（OR=10-13，originality ns 且反向）\\\\n- **Formality = 混合效应**（style + originality 共存）\\\\n- **Register = originality 主导**（style 边缘）\\\\n\\\\n## Verbosity vs Formality 的方向不对称性差异（关键机制洞察）\\\\n\\\\n**Verbosity = 真正的 style bias**（非 originality bias）：\\\\n- verbose→concise: 80.6% prefer original（verbose）\\\\n- concise→verbose: 90.7% prefer rewrite（verbose）\\\\n- 两个方向都偏好 verbose content → 真正的 verbosity preference\\\\n\\\\n**Formality = 可能混合 originality bias**：\\\\n- formal→casual: 81.4% prefer original (p<0.0001)\\\\n- casual→formal: 50.0% (p=1.0, 无偏好)\\\\n- GPT-4o 模式类似但不极端：78.8% vs 54.5%\\\\n\\\\n**Register = 主要是 originality bias**：\\\\n- academic→conv: 89.3% prefer original\\\\n- conv→academic: 68.8% prefer original\\\\n\\\\n## BT Canonical 数字 (D032)\\\\n\\\\n- **NLI-filtered (primary)**: P(formal)=63.0%, CI [55.8%, 70.3%], p<0.001, 88 pairs/173 comp\\\\n- **All-data (robustness)**: P(formal)=60.9%, CI [53.8%, 67.8%], p=0.001, 100 pairs/197 comp\\\\n- Bootstrap: pair-level resampling\\\\n\\\\n## Power Curve Canonical (D030/D031)\\\\n\\\\n| Method | Effect Size | 80% Power n |\\\\n|--------|------------|-------------|\\\\n| Pairwise BT | p=0.630 | 114 |\\\\n| Pairwise Sign Test | p=0.739, r=0.523 | 62 |\\\\n| Binarized Likert | p=0.606, tie=0.625 | 462 |\\\\n| Likert ATE | d=0.073 (raw) | 1,473 |\\\\n\\\\n## 分析脚本路径\\\\n- BT + GEE (Qwen3-32B formality/register): `csd_pipeline/qwen32b_analysis.py`\\\\n- Verbosity GEE (Qwen3-32B): `csd_pipeline/verbosity_gee.py`\\\\n- GPT-4o 全量分析: `csd_pipeline/gpt4o_analysis.py`\\\\n- Power curve: `csd_pipeline/gen_power_curve.py`\\\\n- BT 主分析 (GPT-4o formality): `csd_pipeline/exp016_bradley_terry.py`\\\\n- Pipeline diagram: `csd_pipeline/gen_pipeline_figure.py`\\\\n- Forest plot: `csd_pipeline/gen_forest_plot.py`\\\\n\\\\n## 踩坑经验\\\\n- [2026-05-20] vLLM Qwen3 需要 `VLLM_USE_FLASHINFER_SAMPLER=0`（Blackwell sm120 不兼容）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] 32B FP16 单卡 96GB OK（gpu-memory-utilization=0.90 用了 88GB）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Pairwise position-controlled dual-trial 比 Likert 灵敏得多\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Tone axis 结构性不可行\\\\n- [2026-05-21] NLI-only gating 对所有 axis 都适用（D023）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] Power curve 用 raw d=0.073（不依赖 RATE 假设）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] Qwen3-32B tp=2 可作为 local judge，~13 分钟 3 axis\\\\n- [2026-05-21] GEE decomposition 用 exchangeable correlation（statsmodels GEE）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] vLLM kill 必须用 specific PID，不能 killall（M006 教训）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] 代理 endpoint 只支持 OpenAI，不支持 Claude/Gemini\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 6100, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01En36V24Y5wN7AVuRMBbnW2","session_id":"c31a7728-a7db-4599-bbbd-5af253d1fc6a","uuid":"5f3f544d-7acb-4fcd-be77-e21217e4920d","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:59:23.312Z"}
