提出；R1 AGREE\"\n222\t    action_items:\n223\t      - round: 1\n224\t        action: \"6/6 cells complete (D037)。2 judges × 3 axes 全覆盖。4 strong + 2 marginal Blindspot\"\n225\t        assigned_to: agent\n226\t        status: done\n227\t    resolution: \"Complete 2×3 matrix with BT + Likert + GEE for all cells\"\n228\t    resolution_round: 1\n229\t\n230\t  - id: \"R2-W2\"\n231\t    summary: \"缺少 Bradley-Terry 建模\"\n232\t    category: method\n233\t    severity: warning\n234\t    status: resolved\n235\t    first_raised_round: 1\n236\t    last_seen_round: 1\n237\t    mentions:\n238\t      - round: 1\n239\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n240\t        note: \"R2 提出；R1 REBUT\"\n241\t    action_items:\n242\t      - round: 1\n243\t        action: \"BT as primary for all 6 cells. Pair-level bootstrap 10000 resamples\"\n244\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n245\t        status: done\n246\t    resolution: \"BT with pair-level bootstrap is primary analysis\"\n247\t    resolution_round: 1\n248\t\n249\t  - id: \"R2-W3\"\n250\t    summary: \"Related work 覆盖不完整\"\n251\t    category: writing\n252\t    severity: warning\n253\t    status: resolved\n254\t    first_raised_round: 1\n255\t    last_seen_round: 1\n256\t    mentions:\n257\t      - round: 1\n258\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n259\t        note: \"R2 提出；R1 AGREE\"\n260\t    action_items:\n261\t      - round: 1\n262\t        action: \"5-paragraph related work. 22 verified references\"\n263\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n264\t        status: done\n265\t    resolution: \"Comprehensive coverage of psychometrics, style bias, LLM judge evaluation\"\n266\t    resolution_round: 1\n267\t\n268\t  - id: \"R2-W4\"\n269\t    summary: \"全文零图表——无 Figure，仅 Tables\"\n270\t    category: writing\n271\t    severity: warning\n272\t    status: resolved\n273\t    first_raised_round: 1\n274\t    last_seen_round: 1\n275\t    mentions:\n276\t      - round: 1\n277\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n278\t        note: \"R2 提出；R1 最强同意\"\n279\t    action_items:\n280\t      - round: 1\n281\t        action: \"3 figures 全部完成：power curve ✅, pipeline diagram ✅ (39.9KB), forest plot ✅ (24KB)。Paper Agent 整合中\"\n282\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n283\t        status: done\n284\t    resolution: \"3 figures: power curve (sensitivity), pipeline diagram (method), forest plot (main results)\"\n285\t    resolution_round: 1\n286\t\n287\t  - id: \"CROSS-1\"\n288\t    summary: \"Blindspot 实为 efficiency gap\"\n289\t    category: framing\n290\t    severity: critical\n291\t    status: resolved\n292\t    first_raised_round: 1\n293\t    last_seen_round: 1\n294\t    mentions:\n295\t      - round: 1\n296\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n297\t        note: \"交叉讨论强共识\"\n298\t    action_items:\n299\t      - round: 1\n300\t        action: \"Two-layer mechanism. Power curve n≈462. Scoped to structural limitation\"\n301\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n302\t        status: done\n303\t    resolution: \"Two-layer mechanism properly framed with power curve quantification\"\n304\t    resolution_round: 1\n305\t\n306\t  - id: \"CROSS-2\"\n307\t    summary: \"Original preference confound——需要 per-cell partial-out\"\n308\t    category: experiment\n309\t    severity: critical\n310\t    status: resolved\n311\t    first_raised_round: 1\n312\t    last_seen_round: 1\n313\t    mentions:\n314\t      - round: 1\n315\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n316\t        note: \"R1 提出；R2 修正\"\n317\t    action_items:\n318\t      - round: 1\n319\t        action: \"GEE for all 6 cells. Verbosity confound-free. Cross-axis gradient\"\n320\t        assigned_to: paper_agent\n321\t        status: done\n322\t    resolution: \"Per-cell GEE with cross-judge validation\"\n323\t    resolution_round: 1\n324\t\n325\t  - id: \"CROSS-3\"\n326\t    summary: \"Likert ATE 方向反转——测量不同构念\"\n327\t    category: experiment\n328\t    severity: warning\n329\t    status: resolved\n330\t    first_raised_round: 1\n331\t    last_seen_round: 1\n332\t    mentions:\n333\t      - round: 1\n334\t        reviewers: [1, 2]\n335\